{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-184",
  "title": "Guerilla Networking",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "reviewing",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Guerilla Networking"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **the breadcrumb drop**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "plant your card in public spaces *your people* haunt."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "books, cafes, vinyl shops, tech conference bathrooms ¯\\_*(ツ)_*/¯ coworking lounges."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "bonus points if it has a weird message like “you found this. that means something.” with a url."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **talk last, listen first**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "show up to events, panels, meetups. don’t pitch. don’t peacock."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "ask one sharp question. drop one killer insight. leave."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "let them come to *you*."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **the digital side-door**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "comment on their obscure blog post, not their viral tweet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "reply to a newsletter, not a tweetstorm."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "dm them after 10 quiet interactions, not one loud one."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **make something small and weird**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "a one-page site. a single tool. a short manifesto."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "make it beautiful. make it *you*."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "share it in weird corners. not the main stage. people find gold in alleys."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **the artifact strategy**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "create a physical object people want to keep."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "a sticker that makes someone smirk. a card that feels like it came from a spy."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "your brand in a pocket-sized mystery."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. **leave open loops**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "“you might be who we’re looking for.”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "“if this resonates, you know where to find us.”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "people love puzzles more than pitches. give them *almost* enough."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "guerrilla networking is about curiosity, not conquest."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "you’re not screaming “look at me.” you’re whispering “i see you” — and letting the right ones turn around."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}